# Manuscript payloads are byte-pinned: every chapter file's SHA-256 and byte
# count are recorded in its book manifest and re-verified by
# `npm run verify:manuscript`, by the test suite, and on every server load.
#
# `core.autocrlf` is `true` on the authoring machine, which would rewrite LF to
# CRLF on checkout and break every one of those hashes. These files are
# therefore excluded from end-of-line conversion entirely: what is committed is
# exactly what is checked out, on every platform.
content/books/**/*.md -text
